# Rotate the selection around its center: the right-click menu entry and the
# W shortcut start it, the selection then turns with the pointer (Shift snaps
# to 15 degrees), a click or Enter applies it as one undo step, Escape cancels.
#
# Coordinate model: see select.osmscript — viewport center is window (488, 388).
#
# Fixture layout at zoom 18, centered on (40.7120, -74.0060):
#   way 5001  a 4-node rectangle, window x 120..280, y 200..300, so its
#             center is at about window (200, 250).
#
# Captures go to out/ (not committed).

window 1200 800
load_osm docs/screenshots/fixtures/extrude.osm
viewport 40.7120 -74.0060 18
wait_idle 5s

# Select the rectangle by clicking its east wall.
click 280,250
wait_idle 1s
assert_selected way 5001

# The right-click menu offers Rotate.
click 280,250 button=right
wait_idle 1s
capture out/01-context-menu.png
key escape
wait_idle 1s
assert_selected way 5001

# Start with the keyboard (the menu entry runs the same action). The pointer
# starts east of the center and circles a quarter turn clockwise, to the south.
hover 320,250
action selection::RunSelectionAction {"id":"rotate"}
wait_idle 1s
hover 300,290
hover 260,330
hover 200,350
wait_idle 1s
assert_status_contains Rotating 90
capture out/02-rotating-90.png

# Shift snaps to 15 degree steps: this angle is about 49, so it snaps to 45.
mod_down shift
hover 260,320
wait_idle 1s
assert_status_contains Rotating 45
capture out/03-snapped-45.png
mod_up shift

# A click applies it, as one undo step.
click 260,320
wait_idle 1s
assert_status_contains Rotated
capture out/04-applied.png

key cmd+z
wait_idle 1s
capture out/05-undone.png

# Escape cancels without leaving an undo step.
hover 320,250
key w
wait_idle 1s
hover 200,350
wait_idle 1s
capture out/06-before-cancel.png
key escape
wait_idle 1s
capture out/07-cancelled.png

log done
